<div class="select-none cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="min-w-0 overflow-visible" style="opacity: 1; height: auto;"><div class="text-text-secondary rounded-8 group flex h-6 min-w-0 items-center overflow-visible text-start" data-testid="thinking-status" data-thinking-state="in-progress"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-0.5"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 text-subheadline text-text-secondary truncate" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px);">Mostrar razonamiento</div></div><span class="text-text-secondary flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden" data-testid="thinking-status-chevron"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="20" height="20"><path d="M12.38 24.62a.877.877 0 0 0 1.238 0l8-8a.876.876 0 0 0 0-1.239l-8-8a.876.876 0 0 0-1.238 1.238L19.76 16l-7.38 7.381a.877.877 0 0 0 0 1.238z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div><div class="-ms-[25px] flex flex-col ps-px" data-testid="subagent-cot-list" data-subagent-list-phase="live" data-subagent-pulse-direction="down" style="--subagent-cot-pulse-length-px: 0px; --subagent-connector-branch-window-top-px: 14px; --subagent-cot-pulse-top-px: 0px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="w-full min-w-0"><div class="grid min-w-0"><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1 min-w-0"><div class="ur-legacy-markdown contents"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p dir="auto">Sí, me acuerdo clarito.</p>
<p dir="auto">Tu proyecto es la página web del <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Consultorio Dental Santa María</span> — me pediste que nunca más lo ponga como Santa Ana y que eliminemos al Doctor Simi por completo.</p>
<p dir="auto">Es para la Unidad Educativa Santa María Magdalena Postel, Oruro. Lo teníamos así:</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Página:</span> diseño minimalista azul y blanco (para defender que el azul transmite confianza, tranquilidad, seguridad y limpieza), con menú hamburguesa <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">toggleMenu()</code> / <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">cerrarMenu()</code>, y en la principal NO aparece "Principal" — solo <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Servicios, Horarios, Promociones y Combos, Ayuda al cliente, Otros</span>. El "Volver a Principal" aparece recién cuando entras a una subpágina.</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Efecto principal que te iban a preguntar:</span> las tarjetas de Servicios que giran con:</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-code-block"><div class="ur-code-block__header"><div class="ur-code-block__header-left"><span class="ur-code-block__metadata">CSS</span></div><div class="ur-code-block__header-right"><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Copiar respuesta" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-round focus:not-focus-visible:outline-none transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 select-none size-7 hover:enabled:bg-fill-secondary-elevated enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.965)] dark:enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.9)] text-text-secondary" data-slot="tooltip-trigger" data-state="closed"><div class="relative"><div class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" class="m-0.5" size="20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5 14h1v2H5a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V5a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h8a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v1h-2V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8a1 1 0 0 0 1 1zm14 6h-8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-8a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1zm3-1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3h-8a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-8a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h8a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8z"></path></svg></div><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="20" height="20" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-0.5 invisible"><path d="M24.285 7.542a.878.878 0 0 1 1.22-.21.868.868 0 0 1 .21 1.214l-12 16.912a.877.877 0 0 1-1.415.02l-6-7.958a.868.868 0 0 1 .175-1.22.879.879 0 0 1 1.225.175l5.279 7L24.285 7.542z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-0.5 opacity-0"><div class="relative inline-block overflow-