div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="w-full min-w-0"><div class="grid min-w-0"><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1 min-w-0"><div class="ur-legacy-markdown contents"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p dir="auto">Listo, ya lo hice respetando <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">tu formato exacto y en APA (Arial 12, interlineado 1.5)</span> — no cambié márgenes, ni portada, ni índice, solo rellené donde decía "Escriba aquí...".</p>
<p dir="auto">Te lo dejé con todo lo que habíamos trabajado: <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Consultorio Dental Santa María</span> (nunca Santa Ana), sin Doctor Simi, con los <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">200 cuestionarios (100 físicos + 100 digitales)</span>, el efecto <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">rotateY(180deg)</code>, el menú <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">toggleMenu()</code>, reserva a WhatsApp y todo hasta capítulo 4.</p>
<p dir="auto">Descárgalo aquí:</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p dir="auto"></p></div></div></div><div class="-mt-2 space-y-3"><div data-artifact-uuid="996961cd-96ee-4cf5-aae0-a80b9717fba6" data-code-block-index="0" data-asset-type="HTML" data-language="document" data-asset-id="1472029292649969"><div class="bg-bg-secondary border-fill-divider rounded-8 relative overflow-hidden border"><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="relative w-full cursor-pointer overflow-hidden bg-white [&amp;&gt;*]:pointer-events-none" aria-label="Abrir vista previa" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;"><iframe allow="autoplay; fullscreen" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-downloads" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full border-0 bg-white transition-opacity duration-200" scrolling="no" loading="lazy" title="Vista previa de la miniatura del artefacto" src="./consultorio_files/996961cd-96ee-4cf5-aae0-a80b9717fba6.html" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); opacity: 1; width: 444.444%; height: 444.444%; transform: scale(0.225); transform-origin: left top;"></iframe></div><div class="bg-fill-primary text-text-secondary flex items-center px-4 py-3 border-fill-divider gap-2 border-t"><img width="36" height="36" alt="" class="shrink-0" srcset="/_next/static/immutable/media/word-docx_40.19510re5yjeyp.png 1x, /_next/static/immutable/media/word-docx_40-1.5x.424x_co5-8rit.png 1.5x, /_next/static/immutable/media/word-docx_40-2x.1fr7qso1hf1ug.png 2x" src="./consultorio_files/word-docx_40.19510re5yjeyp.png"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div dir="auto" data-slot="text" class="mx-0 outline