<p dir="auto"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Lo que hice con lo que me autorizaste:</span></p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">✅ Corregí <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Santa Ana → Santa María</span> en toda la introducción</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">✅ Arreglé <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">1.3.2</span> y puse <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">5 objetivos específicos</span> únicos (ya no repetidos)</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">✅ Llené <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">1.4 Enfoque Metodológico</span> con enfoque mixto y los 200 cuestionarios</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">✅ Llené <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">1.4.2 Justificación Económica</span> con ahorro de papel/folletos y herramientas gratuitas</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">✅ Renombré todo el <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Capítulo II</span> (ya no dice TITULO) y agregué lo que faltaba:
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.1 Menú hamburguesa <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">toggleMenu()</code> / <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">cerrarMenu()</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.2 Psicología del color azul (confianza, limpieza)</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.2.1 Tarjetas <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">rotateY(180deg)</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.2.2 Reserva WhatsApp + tabla 🟢/🔴</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.3 Estructura carpetas USB y 2.3.3.1 Usabilidad y ética</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">✅ <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Capítulo III</span> completo con tu cronograma de la foto: Gestión 2025
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Búsqueda: Junio 10 SEM4 y Julio SEM1</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Recolección: Julio SEM1 y SEM5</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Elaboración web: Agosto SEM1-5 y Septiembre SEM1-5</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Prueba prototipo: Octubre SEM1 y SEM4</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">✅ <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Capítulo IV</span> con 6 conclusiones (una por cada objetivo) y recomendaciones</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">✅ <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Bibliografía</span> con los 14 enlaces exactos de tu foto</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">✅ Dejé <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Anexos 1,2,3 en blanco</span> como me pediste para que pongas las fotos después</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">Descárgalo aquí:</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p dir="auto"></p></div></div></div><div class="-mt-2 space-y-3"><div data-artifact-uuid="89c42911-4a5b-436c-ba38-876760a8ce1f" data-code-block-index="0" data-asset-type="HTML" data-language="document" data-asset-id="1475558385630393"><div class="bg-bg-secondary border-fill-divider rounded-8 relative overflow-hidden border"><div role="button" tabindex="0" class="relative w-full cursor-pointer overflow-hidden bg-white [&amp;&gt;*]:pointer-events-none" aria-label="Abrir vista previa" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;"><iframe allow="autoplay; fullscreen" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-downloads" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full border-0 bg-white transition-opacity duration-200" scrolling="no" loading="lazy" title="Vista previa de la miniatura del artefacto" src="./consultorio_files/89c42911-4a5b-436c-ba38-876760a8ce1f.html" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); opacity: 1; width: 444.444%; height: 444.444%; transform: scale(0.225); transform-origin: left top;"></iframe></div><div class="bg-fill-primary text-text-secondary flex items-center px-4 py-3 border-fill-divider gap-2 border-t"><img width="36" height="36" alt="" class="shrink-0" srcset="/_next/static/immutable/media/word-docx_40.19510re5yjeyp.png 1x, /_next/static/immutable/media/word-docx_40-1.5x.424x_co5-8rit.png 1.5x, /_next/static/immutable/media/word-docx_40-2x.1fr7qso1hf1ug.png 2x" src="./consultorio_files/word-docx_40.19510re5yjeyp.png"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div dir="auto" data-slot="text" class="mx-0 outline