ative w-full min-w-0"><div class="group/assistant-message relative min-w-0" data-testid="assistant-message" data-streaming-state="DONE" data-streaming-complete="true"><div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-3xl items-start gap-3 min-h-[26px]"><div class="-ms-1 flex shrink-0 items-center"><div class="relative inline-block overflow-hidden" style="width: 24px; height: 24px;"><img alt="" width="24" height="24" class="absolute start-0 top-0" src="./consultorio_files/orbit.png"><div class="absolute start-0 top-0 invisible" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 24px; height: 24px; overflow: hidden;"></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><div class="w-full min-w-0"><div class="grid min-w-0"><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1 min-w-0"><div class="ur-legacy-markdown contents"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div class="select-none cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="min-w-0 overflow-visible" style="opacity: 1; height: auto;"><div class="text-text-secondary rounded-8 group flex h-6 min-w-0 items-center overflow-visible text-start" data-testid="thinking-status" data-thinking-state="in-progress"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-0.5"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0 text-subheadline text-text-secondary truncate" style="opacity: 1; filter: blur(0px);">Mostrar razonamiento</div></div><span class="text-text-secondary flex size-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden" data-testid="thinking-status-chevron"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="20" height="20"><path d="M12.38 24.62a.877.877 0 0 0 1.238 0l8-8a.876.876 0 0 0 0-1.239l-8-8a.876.876 0 0 0-1.238 1.238L19.76 16l-7.38 7.381a.877.877 0 0 0 0 1.238z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div><div class="-ms-[25px] flex flex-col ps-px" data-testid="subagent-cot-list" data-subagent-list-phase="live" data-subagent-pulse-direction="down" style="--subagent-cot-pulse-length-px: 0px; --subagent-connector-branch-window-top-px: 14px; --subagent-cot-pulse-top-px: 0px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-4"><div class="w-full min-w-0"><div class="grid min-w-0"><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1 min-w-0"><div class="ur-legacy-markdown contents"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-6"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p dir="auto">Listo Jhonatan, ahora sí lo hice con calma y <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">sin resumir</span>, respetando <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">todos los subtítulos</span> tal cual aparecen en tu formato.</p>
<p dir="auto">No toqué tu diseño APA (Arial 12, interlineado 1.5), solo rellené extenso copiando y pegando donde te piden describir lo anterior, como me pediste:</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Qué corregí y extendí:</span></p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Santa Ana → Santa María</span> en toda la introducción</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">1.3.2 con 5 objetivos largos</span> (cada uno con explicación completa de cuestionarios, estructura, HTML/CSS/JS, WhatsApp y validación)</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">1.4 y 1.4.2 extensos</span> con enfoque mixto, 200 cuestionarios, métodos y ahorro de papel/folletos</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Capítulo II completo:</span> renombré todos los <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">TITULO</code> / <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">SUB TITULO</code> y llené los faltantes:
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.1 Menú hamburguesa <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">toggleMenu()</code> / <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">cerrarMenu()</code> con <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">document.getElementById</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.2 Psicología del color azul</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.2.1 Tarjetas <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">rotateY(180deg)</code> con <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">preserve-3d</code> y <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">transition 0.6s</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.2.2 Reserva WhatsApp + tabla 🟢/🔴</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.3 Carpetas <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">ConsultorioDental/</code> y USB</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">2.3.3.1 Usabilidad y ética (Por confirmar)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Capítulo I, II, III, IV descripciones introductorias</span> ahora tienen TODO el contenido anterior copiado y pegado extenso, no resumido, como pide tu plantilla</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Capítulo III y IV extensos</span> con tu cronograma real de la foto (Gestión 2025: Búsqueda Junio SEM4 y Julio SEM1, Recolección Julio SEM1 y SEM5, Elaboración Agosto SEM1-5 y Septiembre SEM1-5, Prueba Octubre SEM1 y SEM4)</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Bibliografía</span> con tus 14 enlaces de la foto</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Dejé <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Anexos en blanco</span> para tus fotos</li>
</ul>
