r(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">servicios.html (6 tarjetas con foto)</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">promociones.html (promos con botón Ir a consulta)</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">horarios.html (tabla)</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">ayuda.html</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">otros.html (con tabla 🟢/🔴 exigida)</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">css/style.css (código simple comentado)</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">js/script.js (solo toggleMenu y cerrarMenu con getElementById)</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">imagenes/ (7 fotos placeholder - reemplázalas con fotos reales)</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-6 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"><span class="text-[var(--sdm-c,inherit)] dark:text-[var(--shiki-dark,var(--sdm-c,inherit))]" style="">README.md (instrucciones GitHub)</span></span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div><button type="button" class="ur-code-block__v2-toggle" aria-label="See all 10 lines" aria-expanded="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="16" height="16" class="ur-code-block__v2-chevron"><path d="M24.62 12.38a.876.876 0 0 1 0 1.24l-8 8a.876.876 0 0 1-1.24 0l-8-8a.876.876 0 0 1 1.24-1.24L16 19.763l7.38-7.381a.876.876 0 0 1 1.24 0z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><span class="ur-code-block__v2-label">5 líneas ocultas</span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p dir="auto"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Para GitHub:</span></p>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Crea repo <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">consultorio-dental-santa-maria</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Sube todo el contenido del ZIP</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Settings &gt; Pages &gt; Deploy from branch main/root</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Cambia el número <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">59100000000</code> por el real del consultorio en todos los HTML (busca y reemplaza)</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Qué cambiar para que no sospechen de IA:</span></p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Las imágenes que te puse son de colores simples, reemplázalas con fotos reales de tu celular de un consultorio</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Cambia los textos por tus palabras</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">El código es básico a propósito: sin Bootstrap, sin PHP, solo HTML+CSS+JS de secundaria</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto">¿Quieres que ahora te lo suba a un preview para que veas cómo se ve antes de subirlo a GitHub?</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="group/assistant-message-actions mx-auto flex min-h-11 max-w-3xl flex-wrap items-center select-none"><div data-slot="flexbox" class="min-h-0 min-w-0 flex items-center gap-x-1 gap-y-1 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:-ms-1"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Me gusta esta respuesta" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-round focus:not-focus-visible:outline-none transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 select-none size-7 hover:enabled:bg-fill-secondary-elevated enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.965)] dark:enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.9)] text-text-secondary" data-slot="tooltip-trigger" data-state="closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" class="m-0.5" size="20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m10.894 6.447 1.715-3.429c.56.107.939.669.794 1.247L13.04 5.72l-.988 2.964A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h6.53a.7.7 0 0 1 .436 1.246l-.526.421a1.09 1.09 0 0 0-.226 1.457.818.818 0 0 1-.19 1.108l-.624.468a1 1 0 0 0-.294 1.247l.105.211a1 1 0 0 1-.447 1.342l-.211.106a1 1 0 0 0-.502 1.21l.092.276a.69.69 0 0 1-.655.908h-4.204a4.515 4.515 0 0 1-3.192-1.323A5.727 5.727 0 0 0 5.042 17H4a1 1 0 1 0 0 2h1.042c.988 0 1.936.393 2.636 1.092A6.515 6.515 0 0 0 12.284 22h4.204a2.69 2.69 0 0 0 2.67-3.025 3.004 3.004 0 0 0 1.06-3.138l.006-.005a2.819 2.819 0 0 0 1.015-3.043A2.7 2.7 0 0 0 19.53 8h-5.142l.562-1.684a.993.993 0 0 0 .021-.073l.373-1.493A3.018 3.018 0 0 0 12.416 1c-.634 0-1.213.358-1.496.925L9.127 5.51l-1.3 2.08A3 3 0 0 1 5.283 9H4a1 1 0 0 0 0 2h1.283a5 5 0 0 0 4.24-2.35l1.325-2.12a.977.977 0 0 0 .046-.083z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="contents"><button aria-label="No me gusta esta respuesta"