w-0 space-y-6"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p dir="auto">Perfecto, ahora vamos con el <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">2️⃣ segundo archivo: <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">css/style.css</code></span></p>
<p dir="auto">Este es el que le da color, forma y estilo a tu <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">index.html</code>. Sin esto se ve feo y blanco.</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Haz esto en Sublime Text:</span></p>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Dentro de tu carpeta <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">ConsultorioDental</code> crea una carpeta nueva llamada <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">css</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Dentro de <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">css</code> crea un archivo nuevo y guárdalo como <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.css</code> (así, solo <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">style.css</code>)</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Copia y pega todo esto:</li>
</ol></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-code-block ur-code-block--v2"><div class="ur-code-block__header"><div class="ur-code-block__header-left"><span class="ur-code-block__metadata">CSS</span></div><div class="ur-code-block__header-right"><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Copiar respuesta" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-round focus:not-focus-visible:outline-none transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 select-none size-7 hover:enabled:bg-fill-secondary-elevated enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.965)] dark:enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.9)] text-text-secondary" data-slot="tooltip-trigger" data-state="closed"><div class="relative"><div class=""><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" class="m-0.5" size="20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M5 14h1v2H5a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V5a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h8a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v1h-2V5a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8a1 1 0 0 0 1 1zm14 6h-8a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-8a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h8a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v8a1 1 0 0 1-1 1zm3-1a3 3 0 0 1-3 3h-8a3 3 0 0 1-3-3v-8a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h8a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8z"></path></svg></div><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="20" height="20" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-0.5 invisible"><path d="M24.285 7.542a.878.878 0 0 1 1.22-.21.868.868 0 0 1 .21 1.214l-12 16.912a.877.877 0 0 1-1.415.02l-6-7.958a.868.868 0 0 1 .175-1.22.879.879 0 0 1 1.225.175l5.279 7L24.285 7.542z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-0.5 opacity-0"><div class="relative inline-block overflow-hidden" style="width: 20px; height: 20px;"><div class="absolute start-0 top-0" style="display: inline-block; line-height: 0; font-size: 0