s="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p dir="auto">JAJAJA tenés razón, si les pones <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">css/style.css</code> y <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">js/script.js</code> separados van a decir "este es de IA, nosotros solo enseñamos todo en un archivo".</p>
<p dir="auto">Te lo dejo <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">TODO JUNTO EN EL MISMO <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">index.html</code></span> como les enseñaron en clases, con el CSS y el JavaScript dentro del mismo archivo pero <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">bien separado por secciones y comentado</span> para que estudies rico.</p>
<p dir="auto">Borra lo que tenías en <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">index.html</code> y pega <span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">este nuevo</span> con todo adentro:</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="min-w-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-code-block"><div class="ur-code-block__header"><div class="ur-code-block__header-left"><span class="ur-code-block__metadata">HTML</span></div><div class="ur-code-block__header-right"><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Ampliar" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-round focus:not-focus-visible:outline-none transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 select-none size-7 hover:enabled:bg-fill-secondary-elevated enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.965)] dark:enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.9)] text-text-secondary" data-slot="tooltip-trigger" data-state="closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="20" height="20" class="m-0.5"><path d="M21.38 13.12a.877.877 0 0 0 1.238-1.239l-6-6a.876.876 0 0 0-1.238 0l-6 6a.877.877 0 0 0 1.238 1.238l5.38-5.38 5.382 5.38zm-6 13a.877.877 0 0 0 1.238 0l6-6a.876.876 0 0 0-1.238-1.239l-5.381 5.38-5.381-5.38a.876.876 0 0 0-1.238 1.238l6 6z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></div><div class="contents"><button aria-label="Copiar respuesta" class="enabled:active:scale-98 inline-flex shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-round focus:not-focus-visible:outline-none transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 select-none size-7 hover:enabled:bg-fill-secondary-elevated enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.965)] dark:enabled:active:filter-[brightness(0.9)] text-text