de imágenes:</span></p>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">ortodoncia.jpg</code> = dentista poniendo brackets</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">endodoncia.jpg</code> = tratamiento de conducto</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">extraccion.jpg</code> = sacando muela</li>
