-0"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0"><div class="stack mx-auto flex max-w-3xl min-w-0 flex-col items-center overflow-visible"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><div><div class="ur-markdown prose prose-trimmed citation-aware"><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 mb-4 flex flex-col gap-6"><p dir="auto">Te hice un pack minimalista que combina perfecto, todo en celeste clarito, blanco y azul suave para que se vea profesional sin ser llamativo.</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="font-semibold" data-streamdown="strong">Cómo guardarlas:</span></p>
<ol class="list-inside list-decimal whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="ordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Click derecho en cada imagen -&gt; Guardar imagen como...</li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Renómbralas así en tu carpeta <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">imagenes/</code>:</li>
</ol>
<ul class="list-inside list-disc whitespace-normal [&amp;&gt;li]:ps-6" data-streamdown="unordered-list" dir="ltr">
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Foto 1 consultorio azul = <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">consultorio.jpg</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Foto 2 brackets = <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">ortodoncia.jpg</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Foto 3 = <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">endodoncia.jpg</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Foto 4 = <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">extraccion.jpg</code> / <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">limpieza.jpg</code></li>
<li class="py-1 [&amp;&gt;p]:inline" data-streamdown="list-item">Foto 5 niño = <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">infantil.jpg</code> (esta es con dentista mujer, la cambiamos por el Dr. Jorge si quieres)</li>
</ul>
